{"ref":"BDB, שָׁפָט","hw":"שָׁפָט","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁפָט</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>he hath judged</em><strong>)</strong>;—usually Σαφατ[θ]:<br><strong>1.</strong>  father of Elisha <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.16\">1 K 19:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.11\">2 K 3:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:31\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.31\">6:31</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  prince of Simeon <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:5\" href=\"/Numbers.13.5\">Nu 13:5</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  grandson of Zerub. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.22\">1 Ch 3:22</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  Gaddite chief <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.12\">5:12</a> (Σαβατ, Σαφαμ [ν]).<br><strong>5.</strong>  herdsman of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.29\">27:29</a> (Σωφαν, A Σωφατ, 𝔊L Σαφατ).","next":"BDB, מִשְׁפָּט²","prev":"BDB, שְׁפוֹט"}